{"info": {"address1": "Silver Touch House", "address2": "Opposite Suryarath Complex Nr. White House Panchavati Circle", "city": "Ahmedabad", "zip": "380006", "country": "India", "phone": "91 79 4002 2770", "fax": "91 79 2656 1624", "website": "https://www.silvertouch.com", "industry": "Information Technology Services", "industryKey": "information-technology-services", "industryDisp": "Information Technology Services", "sector": "Technology", "sectorKey": "technology", "sectorDisp": "Technology", "longBusinessSummary": "Silver Touch Technologies Limited provides information technology solutions in India and internationally. The company offers enterprise software services, including digital engineering, enterprise architecture, cloud applications development, mobile applications, and enterprise DevOps; digital transformation solutions, such as applied AI, data analytics, blockchain and IoT, and robotic process automation; and ERP solutions comprising SAP business One HANA, S/4 HANA, SAP successfactors, hosted cloud solution for SAP, and odoo ERP. It also provides e-governance solutions, including platforms development, single window solution and dashboards, manpower services, and AI powered driving skill assessment solution, as well as G2C, G2B, and G2G portal; managed security services, such as SOC-as-a-service, email security and protection, VAPT service, identity and access management, managed detection and response services, and security awareness training, as well as cloud, endpoint, website, and application security. In addition, the company offers modern workplace services comprising data center, communication, IT consulting, backup and disaster recovery, and call center/IP telephony; and cloud solutions, such as virtual desktops on cloud, cloud monitoring and management, AWS services, and silver cloud, as well as public, private, and hybrid cloud. The company was formerly known as Silver Touch Computers Limited and changed its name to Silver Touch Technologies Limited in October 2004. Silver Touch Technologies Limited was founded in 1992 and is headquartered in Ahmedabad, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vipul Haridas Thakkar", "age": 55, "title": "Chairman & MD", "yearBorn": 1970, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 8400000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Paulin Vinodbhai Shah B.Com, Inter CA", "title": "CFO and Senior Manager of Accounts & Finance", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Kashish Arjunbhai Purohit", "title": "Company Secretary & Compliance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Jignesh Amritlal Patel", "age": 54, "title": "Whole Time Director", "yearBorn": 1971, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 8400000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Minesh Vinodchandra Doshi", "age": 55, "title": "Whole Time Director", "yearBorn": 1970, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 8400000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Palak Vinubhai Shah", "age": 55, "title": "Whole Time Director", "yearBorn": 1970, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 8400000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Himanshu Shishirkant Jain", "age": 56, "title": "Whole Time Director", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 7500000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Pratik  Machchar", "age": 48, "title": "Chief Technology Officer", "yearBorn": 1977, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Rasesh  Jani", "title": "General Manager of Sales", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Mihir R. Joshi", "title": "Senior Vice President of Business Development", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}], "compensationAsOfEpo